{"4335670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Altered Priest", "steam_appid": 4335670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The relics have been stolen. The ritual has begun.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret satanic order has stolen sacred relics to summon demonic forces into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a priest sent by the Vatican on a sacred mission:<br>enter corrupted strongholds, recover the relics, and stop the ritual before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Altered Priest</strong> is a fast-paced, old-school inspired Time Attack First Person Shooter set in a dark fantasy world. Inspired by classics like <strong>Doom</strong>, the game delivers raw movement, aggressive combat, and pure mechanical intensity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cutscenes.<br>No distractions.<br>Only faith, firepower, and the clock.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔ Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter procedurally generated cursed structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate cultists and demonic entities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover stolen sacred relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the exit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the timer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alter yourself in Bishop (early access), Cardinal or Pope (full game)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map is randomly generated.<br>No memorized routes. No predictable layouts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Altered Priest is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version focuses on the core gameplay loop and procedural systems. A full story mode is planned but not yet implemented.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By joining Early Access, you’ll experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old-school FPS combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully procedural maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanding weapon variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing room diversity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous content updates</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future updates will introduce:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New enemy variations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission will grow.<br>The challenge will escalate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >♾ Infinite Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With randomized level generation and constant content updates, replayability is virtually limitless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two maps are the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 Who Is This For?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore FPS players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old-school shooter fans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Attack enthusiasts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want pure, skill-driven combat without handholding —<br>your mission starts now.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The relics have been stolen. The ritual has begun.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret satanic order has stolen sacred relics to summon demonic forces into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a priest sent by the Vatican on a sacred mission:<br>enter corrupted strongholds, recover the relics, and stop the ritual before it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Altered Priest</strong> is a fast-paced, old-school inspired Time Attack First Person Shooter set in a dark fantasy world. Inspired by classics like <strong>Doom</strong>, the game delivers raw movement, aggressive combat, and pure mechanical intensity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cutscenes.<br>No distractions.<br>Only faith, firepower, and the clock.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔ Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter procedurally generated cursed structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate cultists and demonic entities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover stolen sacred relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the exit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the timer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alter yourself in Bishop (early access), Cardinal or Pope (full game)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map is randomly generated.<br>No memorized routes. No predictable layouts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Altered Priest is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version focuses on the core gameplay loop and procedural systems. A full story mode is planned but not yet implemented.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By joining Early Access, you’ll experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old-school FPS combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully procedural maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanding weapon variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing room diversity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous content updates</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future updates will introduce:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New enemy variations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission will grow.<br>The challenge will escalate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >♾ Infinite Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With randomized level generation and constant content updates, replayability is virtually limitless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two maps are the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 Who Is This For?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore FPS players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old-school shooter fans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time Attack enthusiasts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want pure, skill-driven combat without handholding —<br>your mission starts now.</p>", "short_description": "Altered Priest is a brutal old-school Time Attack FPS where you play as a Vatican priest on a mission to stop a satanic cult. Fight through procedurally generated dark fantasy dungeons, recover stolen relics, and escape before time runs out.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335670/84423c5b06b201493607c6808e66a5c8e511986e/header.jpg?t=1775897654", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335670/2bc83fcab84c0c11e44026a025a0df2933edc51d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775897654", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4335670/2bc83fcab84c0c11e44026a025a0df2933edc51d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775897654", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD CPU at 2.5 GHz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11-compatible GPU (e.g., NVIDIA GTX 770 / AMD Radeon R9 280) with at least 2 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit / 11<br></li><li><stron